Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?=F0=9F=90=9B=20Fail=20switch=20service=20calls?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20when=20the=20device=20does=20not=20acknowledge=20a=20command?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Switch turn_on/turn_off logged an error and returned when the Bravia Theatre did not acknowledge the command, so the service call succeeded and the entity kept its old state. They now raise HomeAssistantError (translation key command_failed), so scripts and the UI see the failure.
---
